# The checks branch protection requires on main.
#
# scripts/check-required-contexts.sh (make gates) fails when these lines and
# the pull-request jobs of the `workflow` files disagree, in either
# direction. Add a job to one of these workflows and its name goes here in
# the same pull request.
workflow .github/workflows/ci.yml
workflow .github/workflows/codeql.yml
check core (AlarmCore on Linux)
check gates (version, concurrency, required checks, prose)
check app (build and UI tests, Xcode 27)
check dependency review
check attribution (no AI credit in commits)
check analyze (swift)
check analyze (actions)
